    此 | cǐ | this; here; now
    紫 | zǐ | purple; violet

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 彼此 is a reciprocal pronoun referring to both interacting sides in a relationship, with an elevated literary register compared to 互相.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 彼此 vs. 互相 | hùxiāng | 互相 is purely an adverb that must directly precede a verb (互相帮助), whereas 彼此 is a noun/pronoun that can stand as subject, object, or modifier (彼此的心愿, 增进彼此的了解).
    2 | 彼此 vs. 双方 | shuāngfāng | 双方 is formal, legal, and institutional (合同双方), whereas 彼此 is psychological, philosophical, and personal.
    3 | 彼此 vs. 相互 | xiānghù | 相互 is an adverbial synonym of 互相, while 彼此 can function as a standalone colloquial response ('彼此彼此!').

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 在漫长的人生旅途中，能够遇到一位彼此理解、彼此欣赏的知心挚友，实乃生命莫大的幸运。真正的深情从来不需要繁复的言辞修饰，只要目光交汇，彼此心底的默契便如春雨般润物无声，温暖着漫漫岁月。 | Zài màncháng de rénshēng lǚtú zhōng, nénggòu yùdào yí wèi bǐcǐ lǐjiě, bǐcǐ xīnshǎng de zhīxīn zhìyǒu, shí nǎi shēngmìng mòdà de xìngyùn. Zhēnzhèng de shēnqíng cónglái bù xūyào fánfù de yáncí xiūshì, zhǐyào mùguāng jiāohuì, bǐcǐ xīndǐ de mòqì biàn rú chūnyǔ bān rùnwù-wúshēng, wēnnuǎn zhe mànmàn suìyuè. | On the long journey of life, encountering a soulmate who mutually understands and appreciates you is supreme fortune. True devotion requires no florid rhetoric; when eyes meet, tacit harmony moistens the heart like gentle spring rain. | En la andadura de la vida, hallar a alguien con quien entenderse y apreciarse mutuamente es ventura suma. El afecto auténtico prescinde de artificios; al cruzarse las miradas, la complicidad cala en el alma como lluvia primaveral templando el tiempo.
  #2 | 在推动构建新型国际关系的历史征程中，相互尊重与彼此关照核心利益是国与国之间持久和平交往的黄金法则。唯有打破霸权主义与双重标准，推动各大国在彼此平等的基础上携手合作，才能实现全球治理的稳定繁荣。 | Zài tuīdòng gòujiàn xīnxíng guójì guānxì de lìshǐ zhēngchéng zhōng, xiānghù zūnzhòng yǔ bǐcǐ guānzhào héxīn lìyì shì guó yǔ guó zhījiān chǐjiǔ hépíng jiāowǎng de huángjīn fǎzé. Wéiyǒu dǎpò bàquánzhǔyì yǔ shuāngchóng biāozhǔn, tuīdòng gè dàguó zài bǐcǐ píngděng de jīchǔ shàng xiéshǒu hézuò, cáinéng shíxiàn quánqiú zhìlǐ de wěndìng fánróng. | In building new international relations, mutual respect and accommodating vital interests is the golden rule of peace. Dismantling hegemony and promoting equal cooperation fosters stability and prosperity in global governance. | En la forja de unas relaciones internacionales renovadas, el respeto mutuo a los intereses vitales es la regla áurea de la paz. Desterrando hegemonismos y aunando voluntades en pie de igualdad, se alcanzará la estabilidad en la gobernanza global.
